From c4d8198db09bb0edcb71c65bfca584c4dc448cd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peripheral Pretender setup <pp-setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:34:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 54/57] hw/misc: RN2903 LoRa module on a UART, the LR 2 Click

chardev-rn2903 answers the sys, mac and radio commands firmware uses,
with the documented errors: OTAA and ABP joins after the join window,
uplinks after the first receive window (a pending downlink comes back
as mac_rx), radio tx after the LoRa time on air, radio rx when the other
radio sends or the radio watchdog runs out, and busy for radio commands
until mac pause. The network and the other radio are properties for
front ends: join-accept, downlink, peer-send and an air log. The LR 2
Click pulls CTS (INT) low, as the module drives it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
